xt":"砂漠の住人ではないお前たちは、ここの過酷さを知らん……","source_cn":"你们并非荒角沙漠之人，不会懂得这里有多残酷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD5F92DB58BA71D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1123406007:1":{"text":"伝統を守り続けているからこそ、ブラックロアーの今があるのじゃ。","source_cn":"正是因为遵循传统，黑嚎才会一直伟大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50344711C08D257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123406008:1":{"text":"年寄りは自ら氏族を去る、これは鉄則じゃ。わしは自分に甘すぎた……もっと徹底的に去るべきじゃったよ……","source_cn":"年老者自我放逐，这是铁律。我之前还是太过软弱了……现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B5DAAF040E93510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123406009:1":{"text":"荷物をまとめるから、そこをどけ。","source_cn":"你们站开一些，我要整理行李了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465D945A4E07CD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1123406009":{"text":"荷物をまとめるから、そこをどけ。","source_cn":"你们站开一些，我要整理行李了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465D945A4E07CD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1123406010:1":{"text":"……いいだろう。早く終われば、それだけ早くここを出られる。","source_cn":"那就这样吧，早点收拾完，早点离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"